HST Office: an Accessibility group ("Trợ năng") on the picture and shape tabs, as in Office.

Office's Picture Format and Shape Format tabs have an Accessibility group with Alt Text. The Alt Text
button of Writer, Sheets and Slides moves from a small button among other commands into its own
group, after the fill and border group, as a large button.

- sw, sc, sd notebookbar.ui and their vi translations (placed where the translations tarball and the
  shared tree have the same context); solenv swriter/scalc/simpress.suppr: the button takes its
  accessible name from its command.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
